{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16218190","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16218190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1621819001:1":{"text":"“공연” 스킬로 이 마물을 상대할게!","source_cn":"我要使用“舞蹈”对付这个魔物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AF0B7D35DC9E296","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621819002:1":{"text":"그럼 나는 바로 격투를 시작할게!","source_cn":"那我选择，直接开始格斗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46A21AE771DDBFD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621819003:1":{"text":"그렇다면 제가 여러분을 지원하겠습니다.","source_cn":"既然如此，我为你们提供协助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC0B55B836FAE308","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621819004:1":{"text":"음? 주사위가... 또 실패했군요.","source_cn":"嗯？骰子又投失败了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F3211B748B48A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621819005:1":{"text":"하하하하, 조르아! 주사위를 그렇게 봐도 달라지는 건 없어. 그냥 네 운이 안 좋은 거야!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈……小佐尔娅，别捏着那个骰子来回看了，纯属你运...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C53F776C16D64A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"sa